18\/10\/2026)<\/span><\/div>\n<div style=\"color: #34D399; font-size: 12px; line-height: 1.4;\"><strong style=\"color: #A7F3D0;\">3\u00aa Fase (19\/10 a 01\/11\/2026):<\/strong> 15.00 \u20ac<span style=\"color: #94A3B8; font-size: 11px;\"> (01\/11\/2026)<\/span><\/div>\n<\/div>\n<\/div>\n<div style=\"background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.03); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 12px; padding: 14px 16px; display: flex; justify-content: space-between; align-items: center; gap: 12px; flex-wrap: wrap;\">\n<div><span style=\"color: #C4B5FD; font-size: 11px; text-transform: uppercase; font-weight: 700; letter-spacing: 0.5px; display: block;\">Caminhada (Lazer)<\/span><strong style=\"color: #F8FAFC; font-size: 15px;\">Caminhada 8 Km<\/strong><span style=\"color: #94A3B8; font-size: 13px; display: block; margin-top: 2px;\">\ud83d\udcc5 08 Nov \u2022 \u23f0 Partida: 09:20 \u2022 Caminhada l\u00fadica na natureza<\/span><\/div>\n<div style=\"text-align: right; background: rgba(52, 211, 153, 0.08); padding: 6px 12px; border-radius: 10px; border: 1px solid rgba(52, 211, 153, 0.2);\">\n<div style=\"color: #34D399; font-size: 12px; line-height: 1.4;\"><strong style=\"color: #A7F3D0;\">1\u00aa Fase (04\/09 a 20\/09\/2026):<\/strong> 9.00 \u20ac<span style=\"color: #94A3B8; font-size: 11px;\"> (20\/09\/2026)<\/span><\/div>\n<div style=\"color: #34D399; font-size: 12px; line-height: 1.4;\"><strong style=\"color: #A7F3D0;\">2\u00aa Fase (21\/09 a 18\/10\/2026):<\/strong> 10.00 \u20ac<span style=\"color: #94A3B8; font-size: 11px;\"> (18\/10\/2026)<\/span><\/div>\n<div style=\"color: #34D399; font-size: 12px; line-height: 1.4;\"><strong style=\"color: #A7F3D0;\">3\u00aa Fase (19\/10 a 01\/11\/2026):<\/strong> 12.00 \u20ac<span style=\"color: #94A3B8; font-size: 11px;\"> (01\/11\/2026)<\/span><\/div>\n<\/div>\n<\/div>\n<\/div>\n<\/div>\n<\/ul>\n<\/div>\n<p><!-- CARD 3: PERGUNTAS FREQUENTES (FAQS) --><\/p>\n<div class=\"pr-content-card\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 20px; padding: 28px; margin-bottom: 24px;\">\n<h2 class=\"pr-card-title\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-size: 22px; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 20px;\">\u2753 Perguntas <span class=\"pr-gradient-text\" style=\"background: linear-gradient(135deg, #C4B5FD 20%, #8B5CF6 100%); -webkit-background-clip: text; -webkit-text-fill-color: transparent;\">Frequentes (FAQ)<\/span><\/h2>\n<details class=\"pr-faq-item\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 12px; margin-bottom: 12px; padding: 16px 20px;\">\n<summary class=\"pr-faq-question\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-weight: 600; font-size: 16px; cursor: pointer;\">Qual \u00e9 a data e os hor\u00e1rios de partida do 3\u00ba Trail Aldeia da Granja?<\/summary>\n<div class=\"pr-faq-answer\" style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.6; margin-top: 12px;\">A prova realiza-se no domingo, 8 de novembro de 2026. A partida do Trail Longo (24 km) d\u00e1-se \u00e0s 09:00, o Trail Curto (12 km) inicia \u00e0s 09:10 e a Caminhada (8 km) arranca \u00e0s 09:20.<\/div>\n<\/details>\n<details class=\"pr-faq-item\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 12px; margin-bottom: 12px; padding: 16px 20px;\">\n<summary class=\"pr-faq-question\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-weight: 600; font-size: 16px; cursor: pointer;\">Onde se localiza o secretariado, partida e chegada do evento?<\/summary>\n<div class=\"pr-faq-answer\" style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.6; margin-top: 12px;\">O centro do evento situa-se na Sociedade Recreativa da Granja, na aldeia da Granja, freguesia de Vialonga, concelho de Vila Franca de Xira (Distrito de Lisboa).<\/div>\n<\/details>\n<details class=\"pr-faq-item\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 12px; margin-bottom: 12px; padding: 16px 20px;\">\n<summary class=\"pr-faq-question\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-weight: 600; font-size: 16px; cursor: pointer;\">Quais s\u00e3o as dist\u00e2ncias dispon\u00edveis e tempo limite?<\/summary>\n<div class=\"pr-faq-answer\" style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.6; margin-top: 12px;\">O evento oferece o Trail Longo de 24 km, o Trail Curto de 12 km e a Caminhada de 8 km. O tempo limite previsto para a conclus\u00e3o \u00e9 de 4h30.<\/div>\n<\/details>\n<details class=\"pr-faq-item\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 12px; margin-bottom: 12px; padding: 16px 20px;\">\n<summary class=\"pr-faq-question\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-weight: 600; font-size: 16px; cursor: pointer;\">Quais s\u00e3o as fases e valores de inscri\u00e7\u00e3o na prova?<\/summary>\n<div class=\"pr-faq-answer\" style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.6; margin-top: 12px;\">As inscri\u00e7\u00f5es realizam-se na plataforma Acorrer em tr\u00eas fases: 1\u00aa Fase (at\u00e9 20\/09) com 16 \u20ac (24 km), 12 \u20ac (12 km) e 9 \u20ac (caminhada); 2\u00aa Fase (21\/09 a 18\/10) com 17 \u20ac, 13 \u20ac e 10 \u20ac; e 3\u00aa Fase (19\/10 a 01\/11) com 19 \u20ac, 15 \u20ac e 12 \u20ac.<\/div>\n<\/details>\n<details class=\"pr-faq-item\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 12px; margin-bottom: 12px; padding: 16px 20px;\">\n<summary class=\"pr-faq-question\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-weight: 600; font-size: 16px; cursor: pointer;\">Quando e onde podem ser levantados os kits e dorsais?<\/summary>\n<div class=\"pr-faq-answer\" style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.6; margin-top: 12px;\">O secretariado funciona no s\u00e1bado, 7 de novembro de 2026 (das 14h00 \u00e0s 19h00 para levantamento antecipado), e no domingo da prova, 8 de novembro (das 07h00 \u00e0s 08h30), na Sociedade Recreativa da Granja.<\/div>\n<\/details>\n<\/div>\n<p><script type=\"application\/ld+json\" data-no-optimize=\"1\">{\"@context\": \"https:\/\/schema.org\", \"@type\": \"SportsEvent\", \"name\": \"3\u00ba Trail Aldeia da Granja 2026\", \"startDate\": \"2026-11-08\", \"eventAttendanceMode\": \"https:\/\/schema.org\/OfflineEventAttendanceMode\", \"eventStatus\": \"https:\/\/schema.org\/EventScheduled\", \"location\": {\"@type\": \"Place\", \"name\": \"Sociedade Recreativa da Granja, Granja, Vialonga\", \"address\": {\"@type\": \"PostalAddress\", \"addressLocality\": \"Vila Franca de Xira\", \"addressRegion\": \"Lisboa\", \"addressCountry\": \"PT\"}}, \"organizer\": {\"@type\": \"Organization\", \"name\": \"Sociedade Recreativa da Granja\"}}<\/script><script type=\"application\/ld+json\" data-no-optimize=\"1\">{\"@context\": \"https:\/\/schema.org\", \"@type\": \"FAQPage\", \"mainEntity\": [{\"@type\": \"Question\", \"name\": \"Qual \u00e9 a data e os hor\u00e1rios de partida do 3\u00ba Trail Aldeia da Granja?\", \"acceptedAnswer\": {\"@type\": \"Answer\", \"text\": \"A prova realiza-se no domingo, 8 de novembro de 2026. A partida do Trail Longo (24 km) d\u00e1-se \u00e0s 09:00, o Trail Curto (12 km) inicia \u00e0s 09:10 e a Caminhada (8 km) arranca \u00e0s 09:20.\"}}, {\"@type\": \"Question\", \"name\": \"Onde se localiza o secretariado, partida e chegada do evento?\", \"acceptedAnswer\": {\"@type\": \"Answer\", \"text\": \"O centro do evento situa-se na Sociedade Recreativa da Granja, na aldeia da Granja, freguesia de Vialonga, concelho de Vila Franca de Xira (Distrito de Lisboa).\"}}, {\"@type\": \"Question\", \"name\": \"Quais s\u00e3o as dist\u00e2ncias dispon\u00edveis e tempo limite?\", \"acceptedAnswer\": {\"@type\": \"Answer\", \"text\": \"O evento oferece o Trail Longo de 24 km, o Trail Curto de 12 km e a Caminhada de 8 km. O tempo limite previsto para a conclus\u00e3o \u00e9 de 4h30.\"}}, {\"@type\": \"Question\", \"name\": \"Quais s\u00e3o as fases e valores de inscri\u00e7\u00e3o na prova?\", \"acceptedAnswer\": {\"@type\": \"Answer\", \"text\": \"As inscri\u00e7\u00f5es realizam-se na plataforma Acorrer em tr\u00eas fases: 1\u00aa Fase (at\u00e9 20\/09) com 16 \u20ac (24 km), 12 \u20ac (12 km) e 9 \u20ac (caminhada); 2\u00aa Fase (21\/09 a 18\/10) com 17 \u20ac, 13 \u20ac e 10 \u20ac; e 3\u00aa Fase (19\/10 a 01\/11) com 19 \u20ac, 15 \u20ac e 12 \u20ac.\"}}, {\"@type\": \"Question\", \"name\": \"Quando e onde podem ser levantados os kits e dorsais?\", \"acceptedAnswer\": {\"@type\": \"Answer\", \"text\": \"O secretariado funciona no s\u00e1bado, 7 de novembro de 2026 (das 14h00 \u00e0s 19h00 para levantamento antecipado), e no domingo da prova, 8 de novembro (das 07h00 \u00e0s 08h30), na Sociedade Recreativa da Granja.\"}}]}<\/script><\/p>\n","protected":false},"author":1,"featured_media":66724,"menu_order":0,"comment_status":"open","ping_status":"closed","template":"","meta":{"_acf_changed":false},"tags":[],"event_type":[672,22,497,498],"event_type_2":[33,727,820],"event_type_3":[],"event_type_4":[],"event_type_5":[],"class_list":["post-66725","ajde_events","type-ajde_events","status-publish","has-post-thumbnail","hentry","event_location-granja-vila-franca-de-xira","event_type-caminhada","event_type-trail","event_type-trail-curto","event_type-trail-longo","event_type_2-lisboa","event_type_2-lisboa-e-centro","event_type_2-portugal"],"acf":[],"featured_image_src":"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/09\/trail-aldeia-da-granja-2026.webp","ams_acf":[],"_links":{"self":[{"href":"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/ajde_events\/66725","targetHints":{"allow":["GET"]}}],"collection":[{"href":"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/ajde_events"}],"about":[{"href":"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/types\/ajde_events"}],"author":[{"embeddable":true,"href":"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/users\/1"}],"replies":[{"embeddable":true,"href":"https:\/